e out of the event notes. You asked me to keep that name in our direct messages, and the event is visible to Bettina. Add it to the notes yourself if you want it there.","id":7,"source":"assistant, #coastal-team, 2026-10-19T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"sofia-marchetti"}
